I tried it two ways:
/sbin/dump 0f /dev/st0 /opt1  (~500M of misc. stuff)
Dump came back and said 13+ tapes.

The second way was
/sbin/dump 0fd /dev/st0 61000 /opt1

This put the whole thing on one tape (actually .72 tapes).  I might
have been able to drop that a bit with some blocksize tweaks.
