Hi, 
I solved the 1 hour shift problem.
I had the following link 
/etc/localtime  --> /usr/share/zoneinfo/Europe/Rome
as I set it to
/etc/localtime  --> /usr/share/zoneinfo/GMT
everything works fine.

Sorry for annoying you....

