There is a jumper or two to check out:
J17  In=20ns cache, Out = 15ns cache. Maybe try the slower(20ns) setting.
J28 Pin 1&2 in

Also, for the power connectors: The J33 connector set (inboard) is for the
5V, 12V, and Ground connector pair. The J34 connector set (outboard) is for
the 3.3V/Ground set.

Let me know if this helps. Maybe go to private email, as we don't need to
beat the list over the head with this.


